            "review_text": "Marc Schreiber\nChicago, Illinois4 contributions\n0\nTotal Rip Off\nMay 2022\nI had previously visited Phong Cua 1 and had a decent meal but those 450g crabs do not have a lot of meat in them. I decided, recently, to call up and order a couple of larger crabs and they said they had crabs of 800g each (for which they charged me). When the crabs arrived, they looked like the same size I ate at the restaurant so I weighed them --400g. I called up to complain but they stated that 50% of the weight is lost when cooking them. Yeah -- really? RIP-OFF!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 7, 2022",
