            "review_title": "Review at Phuong Cua Seafood",
            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nGood Crabs at Phong Cua 2\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI read from Trip Advisor's reviews on this restaurant and decided to.check it out since I was in HCMC.\n\nThe restaurant is not situated in downtown HCMC instead it was approximately 30 minutes car ride away from District 1.\n\nIn fact along the way there I passed by another Phuong Cua restaurant .. I visited Phuong Cua 2 beside the Saigon River.\n\nI decided to have lunch instead of dinner after reading the reviews that it is crowded during dinner time.\n\nThe restaurant wise .. it's a big place with some tables located around a open area with a view of the river with some located on the first floor of a building also with the views of the river too.\n\nAfter being shown the table, I was lead to the area where one would select the crabs and other seafood stuff.\n\nAfter I selected the crabs ones can choose how the crabs is to be cooked from choice of more than 10 different styles.\nI chose the curry crabs.\nApart from the crabs we ordered some other local style dishes at the table.\nThey have English menu too.\n\nOverall the foods tasted good and price wise much cheaper than those I had in the City (District 1 area) worth the traveling all the way there. Mostly the local .. when I was there .. i was the only foreigner there.\nRead more\nWritten August 20, 2018",
